      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso - address",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>(Address in Arabic characters: same as in no. 15)</li>\n<li>(Note of postal agency:) (From) Naj\u0101 al-An\u1e63\u0101r\u012b (To) \u02bfAl\u012b b. Mu\u1e25ammad and his two sons Mu\u1e25ammad and \u1e24usayn</li>\n<li>Please answer immediately.</li></ol>\n",
